(6705434, 1003169, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the close up/macro of this.  Appears to be a whisk.  The black and white conversion works great here.  It seems to be a touch out of focus where it''s supposed to be in focus (but perhaps that''s the black and white toying with my vision).<br/> <br/>Like the abstractness of this.  And I wonder how many people will figure out what it is.  <br/> <br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'Love the close up/macro of this.  Appears to be a whisk.  The black and white conversion works great here.  It seems to be a touch out of focus where it''s supposed to be in focus (but perhaps that''s the black and white toying with my vision). Like the abstractness of this.  And I wonder how many people will figure out what it is.   Nice shot.', '2012-03-09 12:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705436, 1003342, 134859, '<td valign="top">Very colorful shot.  Can''t wait to see how this was done (in the photographer''s notes).  Appears to be water bubbles?  Not 100% sure.  But it is in good detail, and the more I look at it, the more the bubbles on the right of the page appear to be "moving".  Ahhh... I''m getting dizzy, lol.  <br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'Very colorful shot.  Can''t wait to see how this was done (in the photographer''s notes).  Appears to be water bubbles?  Not 100% sure.  But it is in good detail, and the more I look at it, the more the bubbles on the right of the page appear to be "moving".  Ahhh... I''m getting dizzy, lol.  Nice shot.', '2012-03-09 12:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705437, 1003201, 134859, '<td valign="top">Very cool and abstract.  Can''t figure it out.  I''ve came back to this photo a few times and am still stumped.  Looking forward to finding out what it is.</td>', 'Very cool and abstract.  Can''t figure it out.  I''ve came back to this photo a few times and am still stumped.  Looking forward to finding out what it is.', '2012-03-09 12:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705438, 1002417, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool.  Very colorful.  The focal point isn''t where I would have expected it to be; which keeps throwing off where my eyes <i></i>want<i></i> to look.  But it''s interesting.</td>', 'This is pretty cool.  Very colorful.  The focal point isn''t where I would have expected it to be; which keeps throwing off where my eyes want to look.  But it''s interesting.', '2012-03-09 12:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705439, 1003136, 134859, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out if that middle spot is actually raised, or appears to be raised.  It looks like it could be a nail polish spill?  But I''m sure that''s not what it is.  One of the problems I noticed was that while there is a clean white background, there appears to be a slight pinkish blur to the left of the object.  Not sure what that is?  <br/> <br/>I do like the fushia color, and think it''s quite interesting.  Looking forward to finding out what it is</td>', 'I can''t figure out if that middle spot is actually raised, or appears to be raised.  It looks like it could be a nail polish spill?  But I''m sure that''s not what it is.  One of the problems I noticed was that while there is a clean white background, there appears to be a slight pinkish blur to the left of the object.  Not sure what that is?   I do like the fushia color, and think it''s quite interesting.  Looking forward to finding out what it is', '2012-03-09 12:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705440, 1002212, 134859, '<td valign="top">Are these really pop rocks?  I''ve never looked at them close up before.  It does have a hard candy appearance.  And I LOVE pop rocks.  Very colorful image, though it appears that all of them seem to be slightly OOF.</td>', 'Are these really pop rocks?  I''ve never looked at them close up before.  It does have a hard candy appearance.  And I LOVE pop rocks.  Very colorful image, though it appears that all of them seem to be slightly OOF.', '2012-03-09 12:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705442, 1003145, 134859, '<td valign="top">Immediately could tell these were forks, but I wouldn''t say it DNMC.  I think it''s abstract and it''s a macro... it''s very interesting.  Nice on the black background.  I think the lighting to the right is a little underdone and the lighting on the left is a little over done.  Perhaps a slight adjustment would have done the image more justice.  <br/>Great idea for the pattern!</td>', 'Immediately could tell these were forks, but I wouldn''t say it DNMC.  I think it''s abstract and it''s a macro... it''s very interesting.  Nice on the black background.  I think the lighting to the right is a little underdone and the lighting on the left is a little over done.  Perhaps a slight adjustment would have done the image more justice.  Great idea for the pattern!', '2012-03-09 12:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705443, 1002906, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like the OOF foreground.  Usually, that doesn''t work too terribly well, but here it does.  I would have liked to had seen the right paperclip a little more in focus, to balance out the two back paperclips.  But overall, it is a nice shot.</td>', 'I like the OOF foreground.  Usually, that doesn''t work too terribly well, but here it does.  I would have liked to had seen the right paperclip a little more in focus, to balance out the two back paperclips.  But overall, it is a nice shot.', '2012-03-09 12:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705444, 1002678, 134859, '<td valign="top">What the heck is it?  Interesting.  The lighting is a little harsh, but it gives that added contrast.  Personally, I like somewhat overexposure in photos, Cool shot.</td>', 'What the heck is it?  Interesting.  The lighting is a little harsh, but it gives that added contrast.  Personally, I like somewhat overexposure in photos, Cool shot.', '2012-03-09 12:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705449, 1003242, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a very colorful, pretty shot.  I would have liked to had seen the focus more on the bottom right of the cup (more towards the center of the picture), especially since that''s where the starburst of light is.  My eyes are being drawn to the focal point, but then to the star, and then back again.  It''s hard to focus on one spot.  I like the shadow cast, makes for a nice addition.  <br/> <br/>Guessing it''s a glass of carbonated water/clear soda of some sort?</td>', 'This is a very colorful, pretty shot.  I would have liked to had seen the focus more on the bottom right of the cup (more towards the center of the picture), especially since that''s where the starburst of light is.  My eyes are being drawn to the focal point, but then to the star, and then back again.  It''s hard to focus on one spot.  I like the shadow cast, makes for a nice addition.   Guessing it''s a glass of carbonated water/clear soda of some sort?', '2012-03-09 13:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705450, 1002809, 134859, '<td valign="top">Close up of binoculars, nice shot.  The only negative I see is the dust on the subject.  I like the lighting (wondering how many others will dislike it).  The subject is clearly in focus.  Nice shot</td>', 'Close up of binoculars, nice shot.  The only negative I see is the dust on the subject.  I like the lighting (wondering how many others will dislike it).  The subject is clearly in focus.  Nice shot', '2012-03-09 13:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
