(6705466, 1003312, 134859, '<td valign="top">Looks like one of the rubbery balls that have those tentacle things coming off.  My boys have some of those.  They love them.  It''s brightly colored.  I think the picture is slightly OOF, would have liked to had seen some detail, but it''s nicely shot.</td>', 'Looks like one of the rubbery balls that have those tentacle things coming off.  My boys have some of those.  They love them.  It''s brightly colored.  I think the picture is slightly OOF, would have liked to had seen some detail, but it''s nicely shot.', '2012-03-09 13:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705468, 1003188, 134859, '<td valign="top">Is this one of those balls that you put your hand onto and all the purple rays radiate to it?  My dad used to have one of those.  I LOVED it.  This is a beautiful picture.  Love everything about it!  10</td>', 'Is this one of those balls that you put your hand onto and all the purple rays radiate to it?  My dad used to have one of those.  I LOVED it.  This is a beautiful picture.  Love everything about it!  10', '2012-03-09 13:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705471, 1002082, 134859, '<td valign="top">Looks like this is a tattoo of a flower, possibly a hibiscus flower?  Nice detail, but I (personally) think the yellow stem of the flower would have been better suited in focus, and the rest OOF.</td>', 'Looks like this is a tattoo of a flower, possibly a hibiscus flower?  Nice detail, but I (personally) think the yellow stem of the flower would have been better suited in focus, and the rest OOF.', '2012-03-09 13:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705473, 1003304, 134859, '<td valign="top">I think that if the front keyboard on it was in focus, and the rest was OOF, it would have been more difficult to tell what it was.  But I like how there are bits and pieces in focus... oddly, it works.  <br/>There are a lot of light reflections, as I am assuming that these are overhead lights.<br/>Nice shot overall.</td>', 'I think that if the front keyboard on it was in focus, and the rest was OOF, it would have been more difficult to tell what it was.  But I like how there are bits and pieces in focus... oddly, it works.  There are a lot of light reflections, as I am assuming that these are overhead lights.Nice shot overall.', '2012-03-09 13:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705475, 1003332, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the few strands that are in focus.  Especially against the green portions that are OOF.  Nice composure.</td>', 'Love the few strands that are in focus.  Especially against the green portions that are OOF.  Nice composure.', '2012-03-09 13:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
