(6706378, 1003222, 3936, '<td valign="top">I like this, but suspect that your score is suffering a bit, as it really appears to be an image of a jet engine, as opposed to a macro shot.  I like the lighting and tones, 7 from me.</td>', 'I like this, but suspect that your score is suffering a bit, as it really appears to be an image of a jet engine, as opposed to a macro shot.  I like the lighting and tones, 7 from me.', '2012-03-10 18:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
