(6709087, 1002935, 142473, '<td valign="top">Strangely interesting abstract... but to me it feels a bit cut up and disjointed.  The eye just jumps around and doesn''t flow.  Not sure how you did this, or what the image is of though... so it''s got me interested.  Marbles?</td>', 'Strangely interesting abstract... but to me it feels a bit cut up and disjointed.  The eye just jumps around and doesn''t flow.  Not sure how you did this, or what the image is of though... so it''s got me interested.  Marbles?', '2012-03-13 19:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709089, 1002678, 142473, '<td valign="top">This must be an extreme close up?  I can appreciate the technical side, but the photo is not really appealing to me.  Looks more like a scientific image of something, instead of something artistic.</td>', 'This must be an extreme close up?  I can appreciate the technical side, but the photo is not really appealing to me.  Looks more like a scientific image of something, instead of something artistic.', '2012-03-13 19:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
