(6712069, 1003156, 92953, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ambaker:</b></div><hr/><i> For some reason this just makes me say, "Lady bug, lady bug, fly away home.  Your house is on fire, and your shildrean are alone."  I am drawn to the dot in the center.  It looks like a little world within a world.  Very nice work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for the comments. yeah, there is a lady bird.</td>', 'Originally posted by ambaker: For some reason this just makes me say, "Lady bug, lady bug, fly away home.  Your house is on fire, and your shildrean are alone."  I am drawn to the dot in the center.  It looks like a little world within a world.  Very nice work.   Thank you for the comments. yeah, there is a lady bird.', '2012-03-16 01:19:22.000000', NULL, 0),
