(6712183, 1003145, 135744, '<td valign="top">Yes it was indeed forks - the title must have given it away.<br/> <br/>I wish I had spent a bit more time on this idea as it was just a quick last minute idea I had whilst shooting another idea. Would have been so much nicer if I had lined them up properly and sorted the lighting.<br/> <br/>Anyway pleased with the result so thank you for all the lovely votes. And no 1,2 or 3 votes - very pleased about that.</td>', 'Yes it was indeed forks - the title must have given it away. I wish I had spent a bit more time on this idea as it was just a quick last minute idea I had whilst shooting another idea. Would have been so much nicer if I had lined them up properly and sorted the lighting. Anyway pleased with the result so thank you for all the lovely votes. And no 1,2 or 3 votes - very pleased about that.', '2012-03-16 06:33:38.000000', NULL, 0),
