(6712486, 1003157, 68947, '<td valign="top">Awwww....Irene....don''t kick yourself.  We''ve all mistakenly taken shots, thinking it was one set of editing rules, only to find out that they were another.  Thankfully, I''ve caught myself a few times but, sometimes, I''ve found out that it was Basic when I''d shot in RAW and had no time to reshoot so, have sat those challenges out.  Hey...so what?  It was a fabulous shot! :) ETA:  I''ve also mistakenly saved the wrong original file (so many shots alike) and been DQ''d because I hadn''t kept the right original.  I kicked myself then too....not that it was in a great score range anyway but...still.  Oh well.  Life goes on and we shoot for another challenge. :)  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-03-16 11:53:27.</i></td>', 'Awwww....Irene....don''t kick yourself.  We''ve all mistakenly taken shots, thinking it was one set of editing rules, only to find out that they were another.  Thankfully, I''ve caught myself a few times but, sometimes, I''ve found out that it was Basic when I''d shot in RAW and had no time to reshoot so, have sat those challenges out.  Hey...so what?  It was a fabulous shot! :) ETA:  I''ve also mistakenly saved the wrong original file (so many shots alike) and been DQ''d because I hadn''t kept the right original.  I kicked myself then too....not that it was in a great score range anyway but...still.  Oh well.  Life goes on and we shoot for another challenge. :)  ', '2012-03-16 11:50:51.000000', '2012-03-16 11:53:27.000000', 0),
