(7491840, 1003296, 2158, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lindseycouch:</b></div><hr/><i> Rim of a vase? Great use of colour and light. I don''t think the thick black border does anything at all for the image, it''s very distracting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>With the benefit of hindsight I agree. If I had to do it over now I definitely wouldn''t use a black border.</td>', 'Originally posted by lindseycouch: Rim of a vase? Great use of colour and light. I don''t think the thick black border does anything at all for the image, it''s very distracting.   With the benefit of hindsight I agree. If I had to do it over now I definitely wouldn''t use a black border.', '2017-01-12 08:27:44.000000', NULL, 0);
